BEHAVIOR is-non-positive

DESCRIPTION
  Checks if an integer value is non-positive (less than or equal to 0).
  Returns 1 if value <= 0, 0 otherwise.

CONTRACT
  INPUT value int 8
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH b15b0b3a

IMPLEMENTATION
  v = LOAD value 8
  is_non_pos = ILE v 0 8
  STORE result is_non_pos 8
END
